---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const updated = 'September 23, 2026';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service"
  description="The terms that govern use of the Proper Facilities Management website."
  path="/terms"
>
  <section class="on-dark tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:38px; max-width:700px;">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:16px;">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="on-white">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;">
      <div style="display:grid; gap:28px; font-size:15px; color:var(--muted);">
        <div>
          <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your use of properfacilities.com (the "Site"), operated by Proper Facilities Management ("Proper," "we," "us," or "our"). By using the Site, you agree to these Terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the Site.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px;">Use of the Site</h2>
          <p>The Site is provided to give you information about Proper's services and to let you request a proposal. You agree to use the Site only for lawful purposes and not to interfere with its normal operation, attempt unauthorized access to our systems, or submit false or misleading information through our forms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px;">No Guarantee of Service Availability</h2>
          <p>Requesting a proposal or submitting an inquiry through the Site does not create a service agreement. Any actual engagement for cleaning, janitorial, or facilities services is governed by a separate written agreement or proposal between Proper and the client.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px;">Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>All content on the Site — including text, graphics, logos, and the Proper name and marks — is owned by Proper or its licensors and is protected by copyright and trademark law. You may not copy, reproduce, or use our content or branding without written permission.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px;">Third-Party Links & Services</h2>
          <p>The Site may reference or link to third-party services (for example, our contact form provider). We aren't responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of third-party sites or services.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px;">Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p>The Site is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, express or implied. We don't guarantee the Site will be error-free, uninterrupted, or free of viruses or other harmful components.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px;">Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Proper will not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of the Site.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px;">Changes to These Terms</h2>
          <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. Continued use of the Site after changes are posted means you accept the updated Terms.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 style="font-size:20px; color:var(--ink); margin-bottom:8px;">Contact Us</h2>
          <p>Questions about these Terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:hello@properfacilities.com" style="color:var(--moss-deep); font-weight:600;">hello@properfacilities.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
